{"title":"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A student thinks of four numbers. She adds them in pairs to get the six sums <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/9/bb90f5600a75999eff9e5c6499260f79f3112628.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9,18,21,23,26,35.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"143\" height=\"16\" />  \nWhat are the four numbers? There are two different solutions.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the numbers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" />. Writing in terms of these, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/0/3b0102a096450868a1e6f9f4086a9ba189f1c393.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/5/eb5b52a95308a2ff9a1ca6a65940d74f97879522.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+z=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/532b55e441b50c97b2e6e64051257c35a8ba00c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+w=21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/1/21152273a456c5bcc9a469fcb08baf3d25522a29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y+z=23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/8/d080611a99ba368b89042ae4ac8c0319f9074d24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y+w=26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"87\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/3/d331671c5097b22394df6bafee6e1c8f0815da8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z+w=35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Adding these up, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/f/52f023d617568599144b79fa9f3a6f3b189091dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x+3y+3z+3w=132$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"196\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/0/e200ac346d024c2368a25c4b7015cffbfd56bb32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+z+w=44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"151\" height=\"15\" />. Adding the first two equations, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6ff86ed1a26d2840fab64f6176738cc4134f2cfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+y+z=27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"125\" height=\"15\" />. Subtracting this, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/9/c299cebb58fc20d93f50cc8c1f3f19c111af4252.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w-x=17$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"88\" height=\"12\" />. Adding to the third equation, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/f/86f0fd6ffa66f263de51a3c3ffaf6066fd166efd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2w=38$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/7/757fda029eb11ccfc0d25a5a9e44e94a161e2c4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w=19$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" />. Substituting, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/c/d4c37261466c0ff756401c32f293c33e111f4712.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/b/69bcb82b69533eaf1e7f91a7f78f32677682202a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=16 \\Rightarrow \\boxed{(2, 7, 16, 19)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"184\" height=\"29\" /> as one of our solutions.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li>second solution</li></ul>\n<p>Let the numbers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" />. We have the following 6 equations from the problem statement:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/0/3b0102a096450868a1e6f9f4086a9ba189f1c393.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/5/eb5b52a95308a2ff9a1ca6a65940d74f97879522.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+z=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/6/d862d80327e07edb91bbdb1a15f66fb9ff9fb526.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y+z=21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/b/81bf88ae55100fdddd34fde12ecccd0648094255.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+w=23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/8/d080611a99ba368b89042ae4ac8c0319f9074d24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y+w=26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"87\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/3/d331671c5097b22394df6bafee6e1c8f0815da8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z+w=35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Adding all of these up:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/f/52f023d617568599144b79fa9f3a6f3b189091dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x+3y+3z+3w=132$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"196\" height=\"16\" /> gives  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/0/e200ac346d024c2368a25c4b7015cffbfd56bb32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+z+w=44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"151\" height=\"15\" />&#160;: call this equation A\n</p><p>Adding first two equations:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6ff86ed1a26d2840fab64f6176738cc4134f2cfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+y+z=27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"125\" height=\"15\" />&#160;: call this equation B\n</p><p>Subtracting equation B from A gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/9/c299cebb58fc20d93f50cc8c1f3f19c111af4252.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w-x=17$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"88\" height=\"12\" /> &#160;: call this equation C\n</p><p>Adding C to the 4th equation gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/e/4cef08063aab31646dbb6e1875e67b0dd3334439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2w=40$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"64\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/4/6f46d5402598bc1d4dc9fb0008ba0d89c7ec16e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w=20$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Substituting w in the original equations gives:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b022dc8ef6d33931fc1ae3d27df3ea0a81b52936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daaf07d9f0a2413768e291d1264b59b3c835e4aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26ec141f8f1fa189de37d9f94f8fddce087289a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=15 \\Rightarrow \\boxed{(3, 6, 15, 20)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"184\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II\">1993 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Northern_Colorado_Math_Contest\" title=\"University of Northern Colorado Math Contest\"> All UNCO Math Contest Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016234138\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 253/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1407/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 94/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6864/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.753      1 Template:UNCO_Math_Contest_box\n100.00%    7.753      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13618:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016234138 and revision id 107173. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}